// Winch lever in the porter's lodge. Sound comes from the SNDINFO switch route.
switch RFM_SW0 on pic RFM_SW1 tics 0
// RF02: the Seine under the bridge.
warp flat RF2_EAU1

// RF01-TEXTURES-1940: the same winch lever in the 1940 materials (Astra, RF01 only); the pair above stays for
// its other uses.
switch RFMSW0A on pic RFMSW1A tics 0

// RF05: the wheel of the motor turns while the motor runs (two phases by Codex, RF05_MACHINES_01); stopped, the
// map shows RF5_ROUS (luna_machines.zs), which is not animated.
texture RF5_ROU0
pic RF5_ROU0 tics 3
pic RF5_ROU1 tics 3
